# Domains that refuse automated link checkers (403/999 to bots) even though
# the links work in a browser. Verified during the 22 Nov 2026 audit and
# the 23 Nov 2026 link-check run (curl with a browser user-agent returns
# 200 for gov.ie; Légifrance blocks automated requests outright).
# One regex per line, matched against the full URL.
https://www\.ohchr\.org/
https://www\.economie\.gouv\.fr/
https://minefi\.hosting\.augure\.com/
https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)?linkedin\.com/
https://www\.gov\.ie/
https://www\.legifrance\.gouv\.fr/
# julkaisut.valtioneuvosto.fi (Finnish government publications) returns 403
# to automated checks (verified 23 Nov 2026 with curl, a browser user-agent
# and a text fetch — all 403). The FI-P-01 row was verified via AIPolicyTracker.
https://julkaisut\.valtioneuvosto\.fi/
